<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1864</h1><p class="ref-lede">1864 in world history: 72 events, 21 births, 23 deaths, 2 works, 1 state founded and 4 that came to an end. 1,042 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
