<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/brazilian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Brazilian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Brazilian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Paraguayan War begins; Brazil will bear most of six years of fighting</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/canada"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Canada.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Canada</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Charlottetown and Quebec conferences agree the terms of Confederation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-denmark"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Denmark.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Denmark</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defeat in the Second Schleswig War costs Schleswig and Holstein</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/german-confederation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/German%20Confederation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>German Confederation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Austria and Prussia defeat Denmark in the Second Schleswig War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-greece"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Greece.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Greece</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Britain cedes the Ionian Islands as George I begins his reign</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/circassia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Circassia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Circassia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Russia ends Circassian resistance; mass deportation to the Ottoman Empire</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/barotseland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Barotseland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Barotseland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sipopa leads a Lozi rising that ends Kololo rule</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/rapa-nui"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rapa%20Nui.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rapa Nui</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The missionary Eugène Eyraud arrives and later first reports the rongorongo tablets</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/labour-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Labour%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Labour movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The International Workingmen’s Association, the First International, is founded in London</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/navajo"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Navajo.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Navajo</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The US Army forces around 9,000 Navajo men, women and children on the Long Walk of over 300 miles to internment at Bosque Redondo</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/taiping-rebellion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Taiping%20Rebellion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Taiping Rebellion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Hong Xiuquan dies during the siege, and Nanjing falls to the imperial armies in the Third Battle of Nanjing</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/tanzimat"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tanzimat.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tanzimat</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Vilayet Law reorganises the provinces and the secular Nizamiye Courts are established</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/liberalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Liberalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Liberalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Pope Pius IX issues the Syllabus of Errors, condemning liberalism in all its forms</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/abraham-lincoln"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Abraham%20Lincoln.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Abraham Lincoln</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He is re-elected with 55.1 percent of the popular vote and 212 electoral votes to George B. McClellan's 21</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/congress-poland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Congress%20Poland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Congress Poland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Russian administration enfranchises the peasants, giving them ownership of their land</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/otto-von-bismarck"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Otto%20von%20Bismarck.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Otto von Bismarck</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Prussia and Austria defeat Denmark in the Second Schleswig War, and Denmark gives up the duchies of Schleswig and Holstein</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/guru-granth-sahib"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Guru%20Granth%20Sahib.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Guru Granth Sahib</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first printed copy of the Guru Granth Sahib is made</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/kyoto"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kyoto.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kyoto</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Hamaguri rebellion burns 28,000 houses</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/kolkata"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kolkata.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kolkata</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A cyclone strikes the city and kills about 60,000 people</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/gondar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Gondar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Gondar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Tewodros orders the city sacked and his soldiers plunder its clergy and monasteries</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/karl-marx"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Karl%20Marx.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Karl Marx</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Elected to the General Council of the International Workingmen's Association at its inception</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/sitting-bull"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sitting%20Bull.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sitting Bull</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He is among the leaders of the defenders of a village attacked by two brigades under Brigadier General Alfred Sully, and is shot in the hip in September</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/maori-king-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/M%C4%81ori%20King%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Māori King movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defeat at Ōrākau drives the Kingites into the Ngāti Maniapoto region, which becomes known as the King Country</span></li></ul></section>
